.\" Man page for pipx-rns
.\" vim: ft=man
.TH PIPX-RNS 1 "2026-05-11" "1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pipx-rns \- Install Python packages from Reticulum rns:// git remotes via pipx
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pipx-rns
[\fB--no-color\fR] [\fB--config\fR \fIDIR\fR]
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A pipx-specific variant of pip-rns. Installs packages into isolated
per-package environments using pipx. Supports all core pip-rns
features: version pinning, offline caching, aliases, and indexes.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS install
Install a package from a remote via pipx.
.B pipx-rns install
[\fB--ref\fR \fITAG\fR] [\fB--editable\fR] [\fB--use-cache\fR]
\fIremote\fR
.SS inject
Inject a package into an existing pipx-managed venv.
.B pipx-rns inject
\fIvenv\fR \fIremote\fR
.SS update
Force-reinstall a package from a remote via pipx.
.SS list
List pipx-installed packages.
.SS uninstall
Uninstall a pipx-installed package.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B Install from RNS remote:
.RS
pipx-rns install 926baefe13daf5178c174f158dae1b45/quad4/LXMFy
.RE
.B Install a specific tag:
.RS
pipx-rns install repo@v1.0.0
.RE
.B Inject into an existing venv:
.RS
pipx-rns inject myvenv 926baefe13daf5178c174f158dae1b45/quad4/LXMFy
.RE
.B Force-update:
.RS
pipx-rns update 926baefe13daf5178c174f158dae1b45/quad4/LXMFy
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pip-rns (1),
.BR rngit (1),
.BR git-remote-rns (1),
.BR pipx (1)
